TG04A5AX6NR\":0.03,\"EVT-01M5EQNWVJTEH3MM57MFSWGKS9\":0.03},\"source\":\"The Block\",\"source_class\":\"SECONDARY\",\"source_id\":\"S34\",\"source_name\":\"The Block\",\"status\":\"ROUTED\",\"subtype\":\"releases\",\"text\":\"Chile's Financial Market Commission (CMF) approved the country's first two spot bitcoin exchange-traded funds on Wednesday, clearing products from two local asset managers to list on the Santiago Stock Exchange, according to a resolution published by the regulator. The CMF had not listed crypto funds in its published regulatory agenda, so the approval came earlier than market participants expected. The funds will hold bitcoin directly and begin trading on December 2. The issuers said they plan to seed the funds with about 900 BTC bought on the spot market before launch. A CMF spokesperson confirmed the approval to The Block.\",\"title\":\"Chile's CMF approves first spot bitcoin ETFs for Santiago Exchange listing; 900 BTC seed\",\"url\":\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-10-21-chile-cmf-approves-first-spot-bitcoin-etfs-santiago-421502\"},\"message\":{\"item_id\":\"ITM-01M5ES7BS9ZJ7PW3VM4JPEAJCT\",\"kind\":\"NEW_ITEM\"}}", "type": "text"}], "type": "user.message"}, "last_payload": {"item_id": "ITM-01M5ES7BS9ZJ7PW3VM4JPEAJCT", "kind": "NEW_ITEM"}, "messages": ["40a8b7a8873f46d5e84613c68146b568be940b4ef09ebb61541f442942bf50c1"], "missing_fields": {}, "model_id": "gpt-6.1-sol", "model_id_basis": "RESOLVED_SESSION_AGENT", "native_execution_receipts": {"sevt_3rltcQtWyouiUc_TBvkjL": {"execution_id": "sevt_req_c835128e4a8cf7127c8868d57d310404410af6ddcaccdd4a0bbeb04518bea76e_0", "id": "sevt_3rltcQtWyouiUc_TBvkjL", "processed_at": "2026-10-21T08:29:43.783Z", "type": "session.status_running"}, "sevt_3wlnWELARbVbMONaN0JGj": {"execution_id": "sevt_req_4d26e1f9a1fbcb55cf8ae7e6473f2b6e8cfe13267030a9256d773efe2e3c2d2c_0", "id": "sevt_3wlnWELARbVbMONaN0JGj", "processed_at": "2026-10-21T08:32:06.904Z", "type": "session.status_running"}, "sevt_53DGfrvP